## Printed
heading: FUN'S CROSS-WORD PUZZLES
tagline: Can You
tagline: Solve Them?
number: No 19
intro: Here is a very cleverly constructed cross word puzzle for you to work out. It was sent in by Miss Olga Lehander of East Seventy-sixth street, New York City. Can you solve it? Fill in the small squares with letters spelling words corresponding to the list of clews and definitions given below. The solutions will be given in next week's FUN.
credit: It was sent in by Miss Olga Lehander of East Seventy-sixth street, New York City.
solution heading: SOLUTION TO No 19


